&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b53b1d98ebace9c5c887e32d8a45b7b2", "src_set": ""}, "body": "您好，我非常喜欢您的作品，我希望您能为我画一些人物。\n人物是一位出身名门的年轻女士和一位学徒女仆。她们没有血缘关系，但却亲如一家人。\n一些参考资料和场景：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1H7YguJPZRTwYT9MmDVAue3vSgyUetz_z?usp=sharing\n您可以选择角色的服装，您可以决定您希望在屏幕上看到的内容\n如果数量没有达到您的期望，请让我重新发送给您\n感谢您阅读我的请求！", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@saltmuke/works/44", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3417044, "client_id": 2545687, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2a53ff1c/uploads/origins/0256faf9-ceee-46a2-842d-a7c03ed4a1bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd8113996ec23def1ae961f90b898bf5", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2a53ff1c/uploads/origins/0256faf9-ceee-46a2-842d-a7c03ed4a1bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=807e00c45ad103a01e115057b16da1cf", "src_set": ""}, "body": "I'll come back to this next time 盐盐好这次来试试双人！或许想看摸鱼互动页......当然您如果想想画别的也可以随便画！\n\n◆ Danny (进攻) x Joshua/Afogomone (被动)\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/2/folders/18hNNTd7oaxgTt79IDzK77HZ9RnAE3WM0\n↑ 个人想看 Danny and Joshua (normal clothes).jpg,但如果您喜欢别的也可以随便选！↑\n\n❤️🧂🧂❤️", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@saltmuke/works/43", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3417044, "client_id": 1421963, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cc91a53b/uploads/origins/a8050553-8afd-4ada-9f8d-0a9fc9dfd7c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=28450aff35daff905855d7e922c4d329", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cc91a53b/uploads/origins/a8050553-8afd-4ada-9f8d-0a9fc9dfd7c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=51edc394048066f03df94f79c5abef1d", "src_set": ""}, "body": "你好，我非常喜欢你的艺术风格，想向你发出请求！\n\n我的 OC: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10lMtc2y5V-53e1VmGJ7Rc3h9bJttvDeZ\n\n白发男（180 厘米，黑眼睛）：暗恋黑发男。\n黑发男（170 厘米，黑眼睛）：不知道白发男爱他。\n\n他们是最好的朋友，总是在一起。小白可爱、温柔、外向，他想向小黑表白，但又害怕小黑会讨厌他。小黑沉默寡言、严肃、不爱笑，虽然小白在他身边时他最舒服，但如果他知道小白爱他，他一定会觉得恶心。\n\n白喜欢肌肤之亲，黑不喜欢。\n\n氛围：蓝灰色，忧郁，夜晚或雨天。\n\n构图就交给你们了！非常感谢！❤️", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@saltmuke/works/42", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3417044, "client_id": 3406385, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b808aac/uploads/origins/2af47062-e95d-4417-acd2-93262d2932a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24dfeabb4b683753706be196b60be4f1", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b808aac/uploads/origins/2af47062-e95d-4417-acd2-93262d2932a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f932dcf870f58cd8e1f28af920c73a6c", "src_set": ""}, "body": "老师好！想尝试给oc邀请，一切都请自由发挥…！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1d9oP0RPpqfe9dnNXSDFQQA8iUmcUiLdJ?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@saltmuke/works/41", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3417044, "client_id": 742906, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cc059b4a/uploads/origins/797f7262-4725-476f-bba7-e3ae9f81f429?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f9f6a2cad546f460fe3fe629a1ec02e7", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cc059b4a/uploads/origins/797f7262-4725-476f-bba7-e3ae9f81f429?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5fb7170c931e57d03c52e29561712b36", "src_set": ""}, "body": "我喜欢黄糖老师人物插画中的着色、柔和的涂色和可爱的面部表情。我经常在 X（微博）上看到它们！\n如果您不介意的话，我希望您能为我画一些有创意的人物。\n\n他是一个男人，是寒冷地区一个农村里的陆地宗教牧师。\n他性情温和，头戴植物制成的皇冠和发饰。\n至于服装和人物的塑造，仅供参考，糖糖老师，如果您能按照自己的安排自由发挥，我将非常高兴。\n我们期待您的考虑。非常感谢。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-4BQNb-fZvPNzvkELXY3IBW5tbCRuKLO", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@saltmuke/works/40", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3417044, "client_id": 3430206, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bc8b7a02/uploads/origins/46833b7b-cd4d-4fe6-b710-24a45197b9b5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=283943dfd15baf5f5635d9e1116a6c63", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bc8b7a02/uploads/origins/46833b7b-cd4d-4fe6-b710-24a45197b9b5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ed84566b778b6fd7f97268602847f3c0", "src_set": ""}, "body": "老师您好！想让您给我家cp画一张图！具体内容请自由发挥！\n以下是详细设定的链接！↓\n大概设定是穿越到1999年的女高中生和自由职业者（暂时在学校打工）是命运共同体的二人。\n不需要太亲密！可以参考以下要素：\n梨花，太阳，冥王星，天文学模型，六分仪，物化生，钟表，科幻小说（外星人屠牛事件，缸中脑，上帝之声，麦田怪圈等），20世纪末复古元素（摄像机，座机，录像带，🎞️🎥📸📼📠📺⌚️💽🕰️等等）\n代餐曲有需要的话是→私は雨\n如果带款有问题的话请告诉我！辛苦了！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DZEA8-6hw9mBqPcjlzTqqHRbDuSbYUSA", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@saltmuke/works/39", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3417044, "client_id": 814521, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/24d52420/uploads/origins/398d8273-3bee-48ab-91aa-5101534c0b4e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b16d06e20d9ce86f2a99425dd00399ba", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/24d52420/uploads/origins/398d8273-3bee-48ab-91aa-5101534c0b4e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e5cff12db468fb65ede9c2eb5749d7d7", "src_set": ""}, "body": "很高兴见到你我叫柯托比拉\n我在 skeb 上看到了你温柔的插画，我想知道你是否愿意为我的百合孩子们画几幅画.....！我想请求您的帮助\n\n潘妮\n参考资料：\nhttps://twitter.com/kotobira/status/1598929585063620609\nhttps://twitter.com/kotobira/status/1366782176893657090\n\n▼ 简介。\n她是一个文静的女孩，平时不善表达。她节奏缓慢，悠闲自在。\n然而，当她和男朋友白江在一起时，她会露出幸福的笑容。\n她总是和志郎在一起，他们一起享受生活。\n\n西罗\n参考资料：\nhttps://twitter.com/kotobira/status/1434161997491228675\n很抱歉，这只是一个非常粗糙的设定。裙子应该是白色的。\n其他设置也只是粗略的，如果您能画得好，我将不胜感激.....！\n\n个人简介\n我是潘妮的情人。\n平时她很直率，但只有和她的爱人 Penne 在一起时，她的善良才会溢出来。\n她爱 Penne 爱得无法自拔。\n她有一张表情丰富的脸。她爱吃甜食。\n由于种种原因，我通常是一只毛绒兔子、\n这次我是人类模式.....！\n\n我想请您保持衣服的原样，或者将它们摆放成便于我绘画的样子！\n我们期待着与您合作的机会。", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@saltmuke/works/38", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3417044, "client_id": 2050581, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fd3309ff/uploads/origins/4f998aaa-fa3e-4805-9907-c20a7398fa9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cec099b527395451ee2e247e30510819", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fd3309ff/uploads/origins/4f998aaa-fa3e-4805-9907-c20a7398fa9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blu